          "settings": {
            "fallback_asset": "",
            "name": "Sabrina Sarmiento",
            "date": "",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "Dr. Felice is amazing.  Can't say enough good things about her!\nHer acupuncture and cupping sessions are pure healing, gentle, powerful, and full of care.  She’s sweet, compassionate, and incredibly skilled (and STYLISH). Every visit feels like a reset for both body and soul."
