        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_asset": "",
            "name": "Adam Francis",
            "date": "",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "I'm not sure what I'd do without Sarah at Felice Acupuncture. I've been trying to recover from Long Covid for over a year and recently moved to LA from Seattle which caused a number of flare-ups, and I was without an acupuncturist to help calm things down. Luckily I found Felice Acupuncture and as soon as I met Sarah, I knew I was in good hands. She's been huge in not only helping me get my symptoms under control, but also teaching me about diet and supplement adjustments to help keep my system from breaking down as much. Can't recommend her enough, her calming presence and sense of humour is invaluable if you've been dealing with a chronic condition for a prolonged period of time."
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_asset": "",
            "name": "Emily Chapel",
            "date": "",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "I was slightly skeptical that acupuncture would work for my chronic neck pain but I am SO happy to went to Felice Acupuncture and Wellness. Sam Audette was my provider and he made sure I was comfortable throughout the entire process. I can't say it was an enjoyable experience having needles twitch my aching muscles but wow, it helped so much. After two treatments, my pain is almost resolved. I know there is some science behind acuptuncture but I swear, it's magic."
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "fallback_asset": "",
            "name": "linda danh",
            "date": "",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "I went to Caroline as I was seeking treatment and cupping for back pain and overall muscle recovery. Caroline was very thorough and attentive - her soothing energy made me comfortable, as did the beautiful and calming space. Looking forward to another visit soon!"
          }
        }
