          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens during my first visit?",
            "answer": "<p>Your initial visit is 75 minutes. Before your appointment, you'll complete an intake form. Together, you and your practitioner will review it and talk through your symptoms, followed by a tongue and pulse diagnostic and your first acupuncture treatment. You'll leave with a personalized treatment plan.</p>",
