          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Many patients notice a change within the first few sessions; long-standing concerns usually take longer. Your practitioner will review your progress with you at each visit.</p>",
